  "description": "The Brilliant Carmen is low maintenance, hassle free, everyday belt-drive bicycle. It is perfect for urban riders to vacation cruisers and everything in-between. Designed to be free from routine drivetrain maintenance, this bicycle is stylish enough for weekend rides, with features that are ready for the city or light-commuting grind. The bicycle accommodates most standard racks, fenders and baskets. Features: Grease and rust-free Gates belt drive. 3-Speed Shimano Nexus internally geared rear hub Ultralight durable steel frame (28lbs total weight) Freewheel with front and rear V-brakes Durable, puncture-resistant 700 x 32 tires Step-Through available in two sizes based on inseam measurement: Grease and rust-free Gates belt drive. 3-Speed Shimano Nexus internally geared rear hub Accommodates most standard racks, fenders and baskets. All Carmen bicycles come with assembly tools and a kickstand.",
